# Local agent only

- v1 execution is a **local Cursor agent on the Windows PC that has 3ds Max 2027**.
- Do not run craft, bootstrap, or kit jobs from a cloud Linux agent. Max is Windows-only. Wine / KVM is not our path.
- Drive Max through the harness (`python -m polycraft max …` / MCP). Same machine, localhost.
- If this process is not on that PC, `max status` will be unreachable. Stop. Do not fake a scene.
